# 🦯 Blind Assistant v8 — Complete Setup Guide

## What It Does
Real-time AI assistant for visually impaired people:
- **Announces ALL objects** — phone, chair, cup, person, car, etc.
- **Warns of danger** — car/bus/stairs immediately
- **Reads text** (OCR) — signs, labels, menus
- **Recognizes faces** — known people announced by name
- **Detects emotions** — happy, sad, angry
- **Detects gestures** — handshake, wave, stop, pointing
- **Detects currency** — Indian rupee notes (₹10–₹2000)
- **Gives directions** — "move left", "go straight", "stop"
- **Reads traffic lights** — red/green/yellow
- **AI vision answers** — Groq AI answers any question about the scene

---

